  "description": "Reduced-basis A^λ_{μν}(I) extraction.  Builds M once per λ, computes SVD, solves the reduced lstsq in the rank-r subspace (r << ambient n_unknowns).  Reuses the SAME SVD decomposition across the three interfaces (pp, nn, pn) since M is interface-independent — a 3× compute win over independent dense lstsq's.  Verifies the linearity identity at the reduced-coefficient level: coeffs_pn - (coeffs_pp + coeffs_nn) / 2 = 0 exactly (since linearity holds on the RHS chi vector before SVD).",
